<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="497218032"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1268152499"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Silence"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Marshmello / Khalid"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Silence"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:00.823"><div begin="00:12.985" end="02:55.980"><p begin="00:12.985" end="00:17.438" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:12.985" end="00:13.252">Yeah,</span> <span begin="00:13.252" end="00:13.468">I</span> <span begin="00:13.468" end="00:13.903">rather</span> <span begin="00:13.903" end="00:14.153">be</span> <span begin="00:14.153" end="00:14.369">a</span> <span begin="00:14.369" end="00:14.719">lover</span> <span begin="00:14.719" end="00:14.953">than</span> <span begin="00:14.953" end="00:15.169">a</span> <span begin="00:15.169" end="00:15.929">fighter</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:15.889" end="00:17.438"><span begin="00:15.889" end="00:17.438">(Fighter)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我宁愿做个有爱之人 不再有战士之身</span></p><p begin="00:16.542" end="00:19.524" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:16.542" end="00:16.876">'Cause</span> <span begin="00:16.876" end="00:17.110">all</span> <span begin="00:17.110" end="00:17.460">my</span> <span begin="00:17.460" end="00:17.844">life</span> <span begin="00:17.844" end="00:18.111">I've</span> <span begin="00:18.111" end="00:18.511">been</span> <span begin="00:18.511" end="00:19.220">fight</span><span begin="00:19.220" end="00:19.524">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我穷尽一生都在奋斗着</span></p><p begin="00:20.003" end="00:23.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:20.003" end="00:20.635">Never</span> <span begin="00:20.635" end="00:20.921">felt</span> <span begin="00:20.921" end="00:21.137">a</span> <span begin="00:21.137" end="00:21.486">feeling</span> <span begin="00:21.486" end="00:21.787">of</span> <span begin="00:21.787" end="00:22.254">com</span><span begin="00:22.254" end="00:23.593">fort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未曾感受过舒适</span></p><p begin="00:23.603" end="00:26.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:23.603" end="00:23.869">All</span> <span begin="00:23.869" end="00:24.171">this</span> <span begin="00:24.171" end="00:24.587">time</span> <span begin="00:24.587" end="00:24.837">I've</span> <span begin="00:24.837" end="00:25.254">been</span> <span begin="00:25.254" end="00:26.012">hidin'</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在躲避着</span></p><p begin="00:26.471" end="00:30.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:26.471" end="00:26.753">And</span> <span begin="00:26.753" end="00:27.020">I</span> <span begin="00:27.020" end="00:27.420">never</span> <span begin="00:27.420" end="00:27.636">had</span> <span begin="00:27.636" end="00:27.998">someone</span> <span begin="00:27.998" end="00:28.249">to</span> <span begin="00:28.249" end="00:28.483">call</span> <span begin="00:28.483" end="00:28.683">my</span> <span begin="00:28.683" end="00:30.000">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也没有过属于自己的爱人</span></p><p begin="00:30.488" end="00:32.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:30.488" end="00:30.739">I'm</span> <span begin="00:30.739" end="00:31.272">so</span> <span begin="00:31.272" end="00:31.773">used</span> <span begin="00:31.773" end="00:31.955">to</span> <span begin="00:31.955" end="00:32.624">shar</span><span begin="00:32.624" end="00:32.856">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经习惯分享</span></p><p begin="00:33.601" end="00:36.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:33.601" end="00:34.132">Love</span> <span begin="00:34.132" end="00:34.500">only</span> <span begin="00:34.500" end="00:34.817">left</span> <span begin="00:34.884" end="00:35.145">me</span> <span begin="00:35.167" end="00:36.353">alone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱只是让我孤独</span></p><p begin="00:36.472" end="00:40.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:36.472" end="00:37.259">But,</span> <span begin="00:37.891" end="00:38.224">I'm</span> <span begin="00:38.224" end="00:38.541">at</span> <span begin="00:38.541" end="00:38.907">one</span> <span begin="00:38.907" end="00:39.275">with</span> <span begin="00:39.275" end="00:39.608">the</span> <span begin="00:39.608" end="00:40.325">si</span><span begin="00:40.325" end="00:40.850">lence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我总是沉默着</span></p><p begin="00:41.281" end="00:43.828" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:41.281" end="00:41.599">I</span> <span begin="00:41.599" end="00:41.999">found</span> <span begin="00:41.999" end="00:42.380">peace</span> <span begin="00:42.380" end="00:42.706">in</span> <span begin="00:42.706" end="00:43.037">your</span> <span begin="00:43.037" end="00:43.384">vio</span><span begin="00:43.384" end="00:43.828">lence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的暴力中我寻找到和平</span></p><p begin="00:43.862" end="00:47.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:43.862" end="00:44.262">Can't</span> <span begin="00:44.262" end="00:44.662">show</span> <span begin="00:44.662" end="00:44.980">me,</span> <span begin="00:44.980" end="00:45.303">there's</span> <span begin="00:45.303" end="00:45.671">no</span> <span begin="00:45.671" end="00:46.138">point</span> <span begin="00:46.138" end="00:46.354">in</span> <span begin="00:46.354" end="00:47.151">try</span><span begin="00:47.151" end="00:47.655">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你无法言说 再次尝试也只是徒